  "title": "Fasoliyyeh Bi Z-Zayt (Syrian Green Beans with Olive Oil)",
  "description": "I learned how to make this while visiting my husband&#39;s family in Syria. It can be a healthy, fast, easy vegetarian/vegan main dish for lunch or dinner that is surprisingly filling when eaten with pita bread, or it can be a flavorful side dish.",
